Package: com.demoloop.app
Name: DemoLoop
Version: 1.3.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Turn your legacy iOS device into an authentic Apple Store demo unit!
 DemoLoop is a tweak that automatically plays a fullscreen, looping video on your device, completely hiding the UI (like a real store display).
 [!] BETA NOTICE: This tweak is currently in active development. If the folder is not created automatically, please create it manually.
 [i] Compatibility: iOS 6.x - 8.x
 [>] How to use:
 1. Install the tweak.
 2. Place your video file (.mp4 or .mov) into this directory: /Library/Application Support/DemoLoop/
 (If the folder doesn't exist, create it manually using iFile or Filza).
 3. Respring or reboot your device.
 4. The video will auto-start and loop endlessly.
